jects CAN-DIST-ARCH"), check("mut-path", "symlinked sidecar rejects CAN-DIST-PATH"), check("mut-manifest-code", "tampered manifest rejects CAN-DIST-MANIFEST"), check("mut-manifest-asset", "manifest asset is manifest.json"), check("mut-tool-code", "tampered tool rejects CAN-DIST-INTEGRITY"), check("mut-tool-asset", "checked tool is tools/runtime/check.ts")]
